    "custom_liquid_WD7Qtd": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 2 1 0%; padding-right: 20px; min-width: 250px;\">\n<h1>Explore Craft at UNBEATABLE prices </h1>\n\n<p><strong>In Stores October 1st to 14th</strong></p>\n<h2>Celebrate Craft: Where Passion Meets Cannabis</h2>\n<p style=\"color: var(--red-500);\"><strong>In-store pop-ups, free swag and the largest selection of craft week in Canada!</strong></p>\n<p>While cannabis may be readily available and budget-friendly, it often falls short when it comes to the artistry and dedication that craft growers pour into their products. Commercial grows, with their focus on large-scale production, often miss the nuanced care and attention to detail that define craft cannabis.&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>Craft Cannabis: A Labour of Love</h3>\n<p>At its core, craft cannabis is about a deep connection to the plant. It's about small-scale growers who prioritize sustainable, organic practices and meticulous cultivation techniques. It's cannabis that's nurtured from seed to harvest with a focus on quality, not quantity.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 200px;\">\n\n\n<div style=\"background-color: #E1251C; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-radius: var(--radius-12);\">\n<p style=\"color: #fff !important;\">What makes craft different? Learn more on our blog!</p>\n<a style=\"color: #fff !important;\" class=\"button button--outline button--icon\" href=\"https://cannacabana.com/blogs/all/explore-craft-at-unbeatable-prices\"> Read Now</a></div>\n\n<div style=\"background-color: #01538c; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-radius: var(--radius-12);\">\n<p style=\"color: #fff !important;\">Discover our craft collection handpicked by our experts for you!</p>\n<a style=\"color: #fff !important;\" class=\"button button--outline button--icon\" href=\"https://cannacabana.com/collections/craft-cannabis\">Shop Craft Weed </a></div>\n\n<div style=\"background-color: #000; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-radius: var(--radius-12);\">\n<p style=\"color: #fff !important;\">Connect with the passionate people behind the plant.</p>\n<a style=\"color:  #fff!important;\" class=\"button button--outline button--icon\" href=\"https://cannacabana.com/pages/craft-profiles\">Meet your Craft Growers</a></div>\n\n</div>\n<style><!--\n/* Media query for smaller devices */\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    div[style*=\"display: flex\"] {\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    div[style*=\"padding-right: 20px\"] {\n      padding-right: 0;\n    }\n  }\n--></style>\n<style><!--\n.button--outline{\nborder: 3px solid white !important  ;\n{\n--></style>",
